  "scope": "Simplify three AuxiliarySeed positive-factor proofs",
  "validation": "Paired target and three tracked direct module clients pass, with phase-specific BoundPell input for Assembly. All client object pairs match. Source-current direct producer pairs are mapped to earlier receipts. Target probes match five declarations/type/axiom reports and global default simp/instance entries.",
  "limitations": [
    "The Assembly search path sampled after builds resolved SignedPairs to old object 5b043450… from pre-f37a2aad85 source 802f596f…. The sample is not a contemporaneous pin proving the transitive bytes loaded. Both old and current source snapshots and the prior baseline producer receipt are retained.",
    "Wider project, Foundation and Mathlib transitive dependencies remain cached; matching direct providers do not establish a full current-source closure.",
    "Target census and equal client objects do not prove every persistent environment extension or behavior of untested downstream clients. One paired shared-load timing sample is not a benchmark.",
    "The standalone positivity probe lacks before/after input pins; paired builds provide validation. Author artifacts are historical and the included independent review/audit verify commit and parent.",
    "Compiled objects and cached overlay contents are omitted; receipts record hashes and paths and independent byte checks need external objects."
  ],
